    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. My main concern is the discoloration though. The greenish hue is really unusual and doesn't seem to align with typical inflammatory or melanocytic presentations. Is there a specific code for \"unspecified pigmentation\" or \"atypical color\" in the dermatological section that would be more accurate than just using a general L-code? I want to avoid a denial for \"insufficient specificity.\"",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
